 op in for the following live screenings of scheduled matches on our main f
 loor. Please note that entire games may end at least twenty minutes befo
 re the branch closes.\n#FWC26 #WeAreToronto\nJune 11-Mexico vs. Saudi Afri
 ca (3-5p.m.)\nJune 12-Canada vs. Bosnia- Herzegovina (3-5p.m.)\nJune 13-Q
 atar vs. Switzerland (3-4:30p.m.)\nJune 14- Germany vs. Curacao (1-3pm)\nJ
 une 15-Spain vs. Cabo Verde (12-2p.m.)\nJune 15- Belgium vs. Egypt (3-5:30
 pm)\nJune 15- Saudi Arabia vs. Uruguay (6-8:15pm)\nJune 16-France vs. Sene
 gal (3-5p.m.)\nJune 16-Iraq vs. Norway (6-8:15p.m.)\nJune 17-Portugal vs. 
 Congo DR (1-3p.m.)\nJune 17-England vs. Croatia (4-5:30p.m.)\nJune 18-Czec
 hia vs. South Africa (12-2p.m.)\nJune 18-Switzerland vs. Bosnia- Herzegovi
 na (3-5p.m.)\nJune 18-Canada vs. Qatar (6-8p.m.)\nJune 19-United States vs
 . Australia (3-4:30p.m.)\nJune 20-Netherlands vs. Sweden (1-3p.m.)\nJune 2
 0-Germany vs. Cote D' Ivoire (4-4:45p.m.)\nJune 21- Spain vs. Saudi Arabi
 a (12-3pm)\nJune 21-Belgium vs. Iran (3-4:30p.m.)\nJune 22-Argentina vs. A
 ustria (1-3pm)\nJune 22-France vs. Iraq (5-7p.m.)\nJune 23-Portugal vs. Uz
 bekistan (1-3p.m.)\nJune 23-England vs. Ghana (4-6p.m.)\nJune 23- Panama v
 s. Croatia (7-8:15pm)\nJune 24-Switzerland vs. Canada (3-5pm)\nJune 25-Ecu
 ador vs. Germany (4-6p.m.)\nJune 25-Japan vs. Sweden (7-8:15p.m.)\nJune 2
 6-France vs. Norway (3-5p.m.)
LOCATION:Queen/Saulter\, Main Floor
