BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Wonder Launch Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T160000
UID:6a1608c3c7d3cd58005be2a3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Adventure starts this summer at your library!\nJoin us at Moun
 t Dennis Library for our Summer Wonder launch party! We will have three ac
 tivities to get us started:\n2:00 PM to 2:30 PM - Sign up for the TD Summe
 r Reading Club and colour your own Underwater Bookmark!\n2:45 PM to 3:15 P
 M - Seaside Bingo!\n3:30 PM to 4:00 PM - Splashin' Keychain Making! Suppl
 ies are limited\, 25 tickets given 15 minutes before the program start tim
 e. Children younger than 5 years of age will require caregiver support.\nD
 rop in\, no registration required.\nNote: Children can sign up for the Sum
 mer Reading Club anytime on this day\, with any staff.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis\, Children's Area & Room 2
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1608c3c7d3cd58005be2a3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
