 na (3-5p.m.)\nJune 18-Canada vs. Qatar (6-8p.m.)\nJune 19-United States vs
 . Australia (3-4:30p.m.)\nJune 20-Netherlands vs. Sweden (1-3p.m.)\nJune 2
 0-Germany vs. Cote D' Ivoire (4-4:45p.m.)\nJune 21- Spain vs. Saudi Arabi
 a (12-3pm)\nJune 21-Belgium vs. Iran (3-4:30p.m.)\nJune 22-Argentina vs. A
 ustria (1-3pm)\nJune 22-France vs. Iraq (5-7p.m.)\nJune 23-Portugal vs. Uz
 bekistan (1-3p.m.)\nJune 23-England vs. Ghana (4-6p.m.)\nJune 23- Panama v
