BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260707T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260707T110000
UID:6a2870a62ea730c17ab59f3d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where we r
 ead stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Join Megan Snider\, 
 author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspiring st
 ories and gets the whole family moving. Class begins and ends with song an
 d breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kids and
  families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses or make up their o
 wn\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No experience\, mats\, or material
 s required.\nYoga Storytime will be held at Hubbard Park (550 Gerrard Str
 eet East). It will be held inside the Riverdale branch if it is not possib
 le to have it outside.\nFor children walking and up to 12 years old with t
 heir families.\nRegistration is required. To register\, online through web
 site\, or call 416-393-7720 or visit the Riverdale Branch in person.\nDayc
 ares and Camps\, please call 416-393-7720 to inquire.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Hubbard Park (550 Gerrard Street East) or Program Roo
 m 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2870a62ea730c17ab59f3d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
