DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T170000
UID:6a0f9f7d8360de907d87ff31@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Introducing Free Play\, a designated space for kids to hang ou
 t and enjoy STEM programs at their own pace. This program will run Thursda
 y nights for the month of June.\nThis week we have Keva Blocks/Feltro fre
 e play! Come relax with us while we build and create structures of all sha
 pes and sizes!\nDrop-in. Limited space.\nAges 0 - 12\nThe program will tak
 e place in the Auditorium located in the basement. Elevator on site. If yo
