UID:6a0766128e677a28001c3a9c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, participants will learn about the introduct
 ion to complementary food and healthy eating for children ages 6 to 12 mo
 nths. We will also cover the importance and benefits of breastfeeding\, in
 troducing iron rich foods as the first food\, other food sources and conce
 pts and teaching on how to prepare and make healthy baby food.
