BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260708T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260708T140000
UID:6a14b454748daf857d59bae5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where w
 e read stories and make them come alive with our bodies!\nJoin Megan Snide
 r\, author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspirin
 g stories and gets the whole family moving.\nClass begins and ends with so
 ng and breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kid
 s and families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses\, or make up 
 their own by following our lead. It's ALL yoga!\nNo experience\, mats\, o
 r materials required. Register to reserve your spot!
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a14b454748daf857d59bae5
