 ommunity stronger! Plus\, enter a prize draw for a chance to win an awesom
 e book.\nFor kids ages 4 to 8. Space is limited.\nWonder Workshop featured
  title:\nAbuela's Library\nby Lissette Norman\nInformation Collection Noti
 ce:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Pub
 lic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 
