DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260706T150000
UID:6a1b44982ea730c17ab2f80f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us this Summer at the library for a screening of The Spo
 ngeBob Movie - Search for SquarePants.\nSpongeBob and his Bikini Bottom fr
 iends set sail in their biggest\, all-new\, can't miss cinematic event eve
 r... The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants. Desperate to be a big gu
 y\, SpongeBob sets out to prove his bravery to Mr. Krabs by following The 
 Flying Dutchman--a mysterious swashbuckling ghost pirate--on a seafaring c
 omedy adventure that takes him to the deepest depths of the deep sea\, whe
 re no Sponge has gone before\nRated G. 1hr 28mins.\nEnglish Subtitles for 
 the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available.
LOCATION:Weston\, Youth Hub Area. Main Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1b44982ea730c17ab2f80f
